  description: A cleansing product designed for rinsing the vaginal canal. It typically
    features a bottle or bag filled with a water-based solution, sometimes with added
    vinegar, antiseptic agents, or fragrances, attached to a nozzle for internal
    irrigation. It flushes liquid through the vagina ro remove discharge, odor, or
    residue. It is important to note that medical professionals generally advise
    against routine douching as it can disrupt natural vaginal pH and healthy bacteria.
